  "details": "Saw this video today about VRChat having to decide on keeping it 13+ or 18+ only and this was my response and a idea for VRChat.\n\nI’m 16 going on 17, and VRChat is something I genuinely love. I’ve made friends, played games, and met so many great people through this platform. Plus spending money, but I’m worried that if VRChat becomes strictly adults-only, younger users like me will lose the community we’ve grown to love.\n\nI understand the need for safety, but I hope VRChat considers another solution instead of removing younger users entirely. One possibility could be creating two versions: VRChat Adults, for users 18+, and the regular VRChat, for users 13+. This could allow both age groups to enjoy VRChat in a safer environment without taking away the friendships and experiences that make the platform special.",
